\n    (is (= [6 10 3 11 1]\\n           (lib '[(apply + [1 2 3]) (apply + 4 [1 2 3]) (apply inc [2])\\n                  (apply (fn [a b c] (+ a b c)) 1 2 [8]) (apply (fn [x] x) '(1))]))\\n        \\\"native names in value position and convention closures alike\\\")\\n    (is (= [0 [1 2] 6] (lib '[(apply + nil) (apply vector [1 2]) (apply + '(1 2 3))]))\\n        \\\"nil, a list and a vector as the collection\\\"))\\n  (testing \\\"a wrong count is the callee's own arity error\\\"\\n    (let [out (run-library '[(defn f\\n                               [a b]\\n                               a) (apply f [1])])]\\n      (is (= :yin.k/error (first out)))\\n      (is (= {:yin.vm.data/reason :arity, :yin.k/fn 'f, :yin.k/argc 1} (second out)))))\\n  (testing \\\"a local named apply is an ordinary guest call\\\"\\n    (is (= [:yin.k/ok :mine]\\n135:Unchanged regression suites:\\n142:yang.python.antlr.gen.Python3Lexer`; no green four-suite result. The stream/REPL\\n148:The independent suites were then run separately:\\n88:change (deps.edn bb.edn shadow-cljs.edn mise.toml .cljstyle src/dev/\\n89:antlr/ .clj-kondo/ package*/pubspec*): it runs nothing; run `bb test`,\\n290:clj -M:kondo --lint <path>\\n439:| `shiva.stigmergy.systems` | 24 / 62 GB | Server snapshot: java 21, clojure 1.12.4.1602, node 25.6.1, babashka, cljstyle, zprint, flutter 3.47.1. The repo's `mise.toml` selects Flutter `latest` on beta, not a fixed version. Activate the repo toolchain before running any lane. |\\n440:| `jupiter.stigmergy.systems` | 48 / 62 GB | Server snapshot (rechecked 2026-10-29): java 21, clojure 1.12.4.1602, node 25.6.1, babashka, cljstyle, zprint, flutter 3.47.8 (the stale hand-symlinked 3.41.9 was replaced via `mise install flutter@3.47.8` after it failed to compile `dart:ui`-using cljd namespaces; if the Dart lane dies in the cljd compile, check `mise ls flutter` first). Tri-host quick tier verified green on 2026-10-29 (see Measured times). |\\n671:1. **Run clj-kondo first**:\\n673:  